  "rulesText": "Your speech is imbued with power. After a long rest, place a number of tokens on this card equal to your Presence. When you speak with an ally, you can spend a token from this card to give them one benefit from the following options:\n\n  - Your ally clears a Stress.\n  - Your ally clears a Hit Point.\n  - Your ally gains a Hope.\n\nWhen you take a long rest, clear all unspent tokens.",
